---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ShopNav from '../components/ShopNav.astro';
import ShopFooter from '../components/ShopFooter.astro';

// Google Merchant Center links shoppers here, so the windows below must match what is entered there.
const CONTACT = 'blake@lovefarfox.com';
---

<Layout title="Shipping & Returns | Far Fox Shop" description="How Far Fox shop orders are made and shipped, how long delivery takes, and what to do if something arrives damaged or misprinted.">
  <ShopNav />
  <main class="pt-28 pb-20 px-6">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-10 text-fox-text-light leading-relaxed">
      <header>
        <p class="text-sm font-700 mb-4"><a href="/shop/" class="hover:text-fox-pink">Shop</a> / <span class="text-fox-text">Shipping &amp; returns</span></p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-900 tracking-tight text-fox-text">Shipping &amp; returns</h1>
      </header>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-900 text-fox-text mb-3">Shipping</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Every item is printed to order, which takes 2–5 business days.</li>
          <li>Orders to the US usually arrive 5–10 business days after you order. International orders usually take 1–3 weeks.</li>
          <li>The shipping cost is shown at checkout before you pay.</li>
          <li>Sending a gift? Put their address in at checkout and it goes straight to them.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-900 text-fox-text mb-3">Damaged, misprinted or wrong item</h2>
        <p>If your order arrives damaged, misprinted, defective or isn't what you ordered, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`} class="font-800 text-fox-pink hover:text-fox-purple">{CONTACT}</a> within 30 days of delivery with your order number and a photo. We'll send a free replacement or give you a full refund, whichever you prefer. You don't need to send the item back.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-900 text-fox-text mb-3">Other returns</h2>
        <p>Because each piece is made just for you, and jerseys can carry a name and number, we can't accept returns or exchanges for a change of mind or the wrong size. Each product page lists the fit and fabric to help you choose. If you're unsure about a size, email us before ordering and we'll help.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-900 text-fox-text mb-3">Cancelling an order</h2>
        <p>Orders go to the printer quickly, so email us as soon as you can. If it hasn't been printed yet, we'll cancel it and refund you in full.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
  <ShopFooter />
</Layout>
